      "source": "Marker interface to describe configuration classes that ship Jackson modules that are supposed to be added to the\nJackson <code>ObjectMapper</code> configured for <a href=\"EnableSpringDataWebSupport.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.web.config\"><code>EnableSpringDataWebSupport</code></a>.",
      "translation": "标记接口，用于描述那些随 Jackson 模块一起分发的配置类。这些模块旨在被添加到为 <a href=\"EnableSpringDataWebSupport.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.web.config 中的注解接口\"><code>EnableSpringDataWebSupport</code></a> 配置的 Jackson <code>ObjectMapper</code> 中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
